{"id": "b9e5b31d-685b-4e4c-8d81-7c99fc9876b6", "slug": "saas-finance-platform", "title": "SaaS Finance Platform", "description": "Saas Finance Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"SaaS Finance Platform\"\ndescription: \"Saas Finance Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#84CC16\"\n  secondary: \"#18181B\"\n  accent: \"#84CC16\"\n  background: \"#0F1115\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# SaaS Finance Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 1; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nSaas Finance Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSystem Status: Optimal TREASURY PLATFORM. Institutional-grade liquidity infrastructure designed for global scale and programmatic routing. Starting Base Yield 1.25% Typical Term Length 30 DAYS — 60 MOS Network Live 01/…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: TREASURY PLATFORM.; Global Payouts; Live Analytics; Yield Optimization; Risk Mitigation.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #84CC16, secondary #18181B, accent #84CC16, background #0F1115, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>SaaS Finance Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Main Grid Container -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6 relative\">\n\n        <!-- ROW 1 -->\n\n        <!-- Main Title Area -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent col-span-1 md:col-span-2\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-12 relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-[2px]\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-lime-500 rounded-sm\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-lime-500 rounded-sm\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-lime-500 rounded-sm\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 tracking-widest uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">System Status: Optimal</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none mb-6\">\n                        TREASURY <br> PLATFORM.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest leading-relaxed max-w-sm\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Institutional-grade liquidity infrastructure designed for global scale and programmatic routing.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Metric 1: Interest Rate -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent col-span-1\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Starting Base Yield</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mt-2 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\">1.25%</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- SVG Animated Line Chart -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-16 mt-auto\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" fill=\"none\" class=\"w-full h-full overflow-visible\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,35 Q15,35 25,25 T50,20 T75,10 T100,5\" stroke=\"#84cc16\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"150\" stroke-dashoffset=\"150\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"150;0\" dur=\"2.5s\" fill=\"freeze\" calcMode=\"spline\" keySplines=\"0.4 0 0.2 1\" keyTimes=\"0;1\" />\n                        </path>\n                        <path d=\"M0,35 Q15,35 25,25 T50,20 T75,10 T100,5 L100,40 L0,40 Z\" fill=\"url(#limeGrad)\" opacity=\"0\">\n                            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0.3\" dur=\"2.5s\" fill=\"freeze\" begin=\"0.2s\"/>\n                        </path>\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"limeGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#84cc16\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#84cc16\" stop-opacity=\"0\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Metric 2: Term Length & WebGL Dots -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent col-span-1\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Typical Term Length</span>\n                    <div class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mt-2 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\">30 DAYS — 60 MOS</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Term WebGL Dots Container -->\n                <div id=\"webgl-term-mount\" class=\"relative z-0 w-full h-16 mt-auto opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ROW 2 & 3 -->\n\n        <!-- Main WebGL Area -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent col-span-1 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 min-h-[400px]\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-2 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none z-10\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Container for ThreeJS -->\n                <div id=\"webgl-main-mount\" class=\"w-full h-full absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Overlay gradient for depth -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-zinc-950 via-transparent to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Overlay Interface -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 z-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-lime-500\" style=\"animation: pulse 2s infinite;\">\n                            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.2;1;0.2\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Network Live</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Advantage Card 01 -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-12 relative z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">01/</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                        Global Payouts\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lime-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed pr-2\">\n                        Execute cross-border transactions seamlessly across emerging markets with precision routing.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Advantage Card 02 -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-12 relative z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">02/</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                        Live Analytics\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lime-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed pr-2\">\n                        Monitor capital flow and operational telemetry with absolute millisecond precision.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Advantage Card 03 -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-12 relative z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">03/</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                        Yield Optimization\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lime-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed pr-2\">\n                        Deploy idle capital instantly through algorithmically managed distributed liquidity pools.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Advantage Card 04 -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] transition-colors duration-700 hover:from-lime-500/40 hover:to-transparent flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-full rounded-[15px] bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-12 relative z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">04/</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-600 group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                        Risk Mitigation\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lime-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed pr-2\">\n                        Secure assets in mathematically isolated, programmatically compliant smart environments.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // --- MAIN WEBGL: Waving Dot Grid ---\n            const mainMount = document.getElementById('webgl-main-mount');\n            if (mainMount) {\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, mainMount.clientWidth / mainMount.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n\n                renderer.setSize(mainMount.clientWidth, mainMount.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                mainMount.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                // Create Point Grid\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(20, 15, 40, 30);\n                const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                    color: 0x84cc16, // Lime 500\n                    size: 0.04,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.6\n                });\n\n                const plane = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n                plane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2.2;\n                plane.position.y = -2;\n                scene.add(plane);\n\n                camera.position.z = 5;\n                camera.position.y = 1;\n\n                // Animation\n                let time = 0;\n                const positions = geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                const initialZ = new Float32Array(positions.length / 3);\n                for(let i=0; i<positions.length; i+=3) {\n                    initialZ[i/3] = positions[i+2];\n                }\n\n                function animateMain() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animateMain);\n                    time += 0.02;\n\n                    for(let i=0; i<positions.length; i+=3) {\n                        const x = positions[i];\n                        const y = positions[i+1];\n                        // Wavy organic motion\n                        positions[i+2] = Math.sin(time * 0.5 + x * 0.5) * 0.5 + Math.cos(time * 0.3 + y * 0.5) * 0.5;\n                    }\n                    geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n                animateMain();\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!mainMount) return;\n                    camera.aspect = mainMount.clientWidth / mainMount.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(mainMount.clientWidth, mainMount.clientHeight);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // --- TERM WEBGL: Timeline Dots ---\n            const termMount = document.getElementById('webgl-term-mount');\n            if (termMount) {\n                const scene2 = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera2 = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50, termMount.clientWidth / termMount.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n                const renderer2 = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n\n                renderer2.setSize(termMount.clientWidth, termMount.clientHeight);\n                renderer2.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                termMount.appendChild(renderer2.domElement);\n\n                const count = 30; // Representing dots in timeline\n                const geo2 = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n                const pos2 = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n\n                // Spread dots in a horizontal line\n                for(let i=0; i<count; i++) {\n                    pos2[i*3] = (i / count) * 10 - 5; // X\n                    pos2[i*3 + 1] = 0;                // Y\n                    pos2[i*3 + 2] = 0;                // Z\n                }\n                geo2.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(pos2, 3));\n\n                const mat2 = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                    color: 0x84cc16,\n                    size: 0.15,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.8\n                });\n\n                const points2 = new THREE.Points(geo2, mat2);\n                scene2.add(points2);\n\n                // Add a connecting line behind the dots\n                const lineMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x84cc16, transparent: true, opacity: 0.2 });\n                const line = new THREE.Line(geo2, lineMat);\n                scene2.add(line);\n\n                camera2.position.z = 6;\n\n                let time2 = 0;\n                function animateTerm() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animateTerm);\n                    time2 += 0.05;\n\n                    const p = geo2.attributes.position.array;\n                    for(let i=0; i<count; i++) {\n                        // Create a pulsing wave effect passing through the timeline\n                        const x = p[i*3];\n                        p[i*3 + 1] = Math.sin(time2 + x) * 0.3;\n                    }\n                    geo2.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                    renderer2.render(scene2, camera2);\n                }\n                animateTerm();\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!termMount) return;\n                    camera2.aspect = termMount.clientWidth / termMount.clientHeight;\n                    camera2.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer2.setSize(termMount.clientWidth, termMount.clientHeight);\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "saas-finance-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/saas-finance-platform.jpg", "source_name": "saas-finance-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 162, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-04T00:04:22.336801+00:00"}